{"lines":[{"x":0.13168724778590576,"h":0.014550291607320909,"c":1,"y":0.10029069753082576,"w":0.21604937235514324,"t":"Sample Writing answers"},{"x":0.13168724018301389,"t":"Here is the examiner's comment:","w":0.29423868815104171,"h":0.013081395583944722,"y":0.14389534871504939,"c":1},{"x":0.1748971218550065,"c":1,"h":0.017667844522968212,"t":"This is a full and detailed description of the data contained in the graph,","w":0.63374486287434895,"y":0.17285041217977914},{"w":0.74313878377278642,"c":1,"t":"supplemented by a comparison of the variations in the numbers for the two types of","x":0.17268723177510992,"y":0.18853254613509529,"h":0.021000308338969598},{"x":0.17477212858115326,"w":0.73070454915364591,"c":1,"t":"visitors (staying on cruise ships or staying on the island). There is a clear overview","y":0.20621125718861233,"h":0.019458002420701725},{"h":0.018716213419524452,"y":0.22357236435915373,"t":"at the end of the description. Organisation is fairly clear and progresses logically","x":0.17480099005099684,"c":1,"w":0.71006388346354166},{"y":0.23900509812811654,"c":1,"t":"across the time period, although it could be improved by subdividing the rather","w":0.69582707722981763,"h":0.02122156527354091,"x":0.17472521575659328},{"w":0.70389180501302084,"t":"long second paragraph. The range of vocabulary is wide enough to show some","x":0.17274830679966044,"y":0.25666346046481658,"h":0.019315252315310061,"c":1},{"x":0.17271476329308399,"t":"variety of expression [adds up to | totals up to] and some use of collocation","h":0.019936221227207729,"y":0.2728898725807043,"w":0.66691960652669269,"c":1},{"w":0.74104420979817709,"h":0.021992778890405296,"c":1,"y":0.28930815304576396,"t":"[three... years in a row]. There is a high level of accuracy in grammatical control, in","x":0.1727168319620076},{"y":0.30599958061632115,"w":0.73280359903971348,"t":"both simple and complex structures, but there is an omission of a full stop between","x":0.17475665034322077,"h":0.021378356520222574,"c":1},{"w":0.73045267740885422,"h":0.01598837238037687,"y":0.32412790682910986,"x":0.17489711805462851,"c":1,"t":"the first and second sentences and no capital letter to indicate the beginning of the"},{"w":0.13374485015869142,"h":0.013081395583944833,"c":1,"t":"new sentence.","x":0.17489712225718834,"y":0.34447674399581829},{"y":0.91715116260773688,"x":0.13580246959551145,"w":0.03497942288716635,"c":1,"t":"130","h":0.013081395583944722}],"w":2400,"h":3395}